    <string name="reset">Reset</string>
    <string name="help_text">Fill the grid so every row, every column and every 3×3 box contains the digits 1 to 9 exactly once.\n\n• Tap a cell, then a number.\n• Notes mode adds small pencil marks instead.\n• Hint fills in one correct cell.\n• Red digits break a rule or don\'t match the solution.\n\nStars: finish with no hints and no mistakes for ★★★. A hint or a mistake costs one star each.\n\nLevels unlock one at a time in each difficulty. The Daily Challenge is a new puzzle each day.\n\nImport your own puzzles as 81 digits (SDK81-v1): row by row, 0 for an empty cell.</string>

